<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-11-04T06:46:23.635Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 06:46:23 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The United States struck Iran's Qeshm Island, prompting Iran to warn of a new battlefield and to say it would reopen the Strait of Hormuz within two days if U.S. conditions are met. Israeli officials have called for new strikes on Iran while a missile hit a building in Tel Aviv. Yemen's government accused the IRGC and Hezbollah of sending 21 experts to support the Houthis in clashes near Taiz that left residents in panic. 123 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/02/iran-says-it-can-reopen-hormuz-in-two-days-if-us-meets-conditions&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/03/us-strikes-irans-qeshm-island-ahead-of-midterm-elections&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/yemen-houthi-clashes-near-taiz-leave-residents-in-a-state-of-panic/a-79836913?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/03/iran-warns-of-new-battlefield-after-reported-us-strike-on-qeshm&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/nov/02/oil-price-falls-amid-hope-of-a-breakthrough-to-end-iran-war&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxOSWV5ajRFb0NDYTlwZkNvaVdiNDV6VlVfbVlBVldIbGNsN3FlLUEyQy1XbTFldU5QUXh1VDloWlZKSlZFaDY5a2lpVDg0dkZtNFh6ajR4V2pTRjI2cDJJUDd0S2pTOG53bGhHN04wY3BXVks0c3dlOEZ3Um16WFUydVBXZWxxZjd5dmpvbTlOR1JNTVRTLS1WOC1fMEFMbUI0OGdWd1JtdkcyR1Z6cDZpZA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxPNk05aEdxMGZPY2dSX3NGVHRlenk0ejJTTW9ZUUMtU2U2ZXBZNlFHUGhMMmtBUldqRnc4UnFCMjBDV0dRRGZpQnR4VlJ